{
  "slug": "kidney-bean-tofu-chili",
  "name": "Kidney bean and tofu chili",
  "description": "A thick weeknight chili of kidney beans, crumbled tofu and mushrooms in a spiced tomato base — three servings from one pot in under half an hour.",
  "iconKey": "pot",
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the canola oil in a large pot over medium heat and cook the onion and bell pepper for 5 minutes, until soft.",
    "Add the garlic, the chili powder and the ground cumin and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the mushrooms and cook for 4 minutes, until they have given up their liquid.",
    "Crumble in the tofu, add the chopped tomato and the salt, and simmer for 6 minutes, stirring now and then.",
    "Stir in the kidney beans and simmer for 5 minutes more, until the chili is thick enough to hold a spoon upright."
